                        "developer_response": "Thank you so much for giving it a try and reviewing it! I'm sorry for the accidental loss of the progress, but this >>>won't be a problem anymore, as a confirmation will pop up now properly! (Update should be up anytime now).<<< Also, the keyboard issue seems to be due to some keyboards limitation, regarless of the game/app, some keyboards are limited to a few buttons pressed simultaneously, thus another reason for the controller use being advised.\n\nI see you got very far from where you stopped at the review video! Too bad we haven't seen your progress on video, cause it would be very entertaining to watch XD\nGood luck and have a good time!",
